      "content": "When I mentioned \"affecting integrations,\" I meant that certain workflows or services relying on the advanced reasoning modules may break or become obsolete after the rollback. However, as you'll see in the UI, the primary functions and core functionalities will continue to operate. The autonomy layers are primarily responsible for adapting to new information and adjusting responses accordingly, which will not be necessary if the system is rolling back to a more traditional, rules-based approach.",
